{
  "tema": 9341,
  "slug": "ambos-ambas-los-dos",
  "titulo": "How to say both: ambos, los dos",
  "subtitulo": "Ambos hermanos surfean. Los dos viven en Rosarito.",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "Both is ambos / ambas (+ plural noun, no article) or los dos / las dos (with the article). Both agree in gender. Los dos is the everyday choice; ambos sounds a little more formal. Both X and Y is tanto X como Y.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "There are two ways to say **both**:"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "",
            "Masculine",
            "Feminine"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "Formal-ish",
              "ambos",
              "ambas"
            ],
            [
              "Everyday",
              "los dos",
              "las dos"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Ambos** never takes an article: **ambos hermanos**. **Los dos** always does: **los dos hermanos**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Both can stand alone, without a noun: **Ambos son buenos.** **Las dos trabajan.**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "With **we** or **you all**, the verb follows the real subject: **Los dos vivimos aquí.** _(Both of us live here.)_"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "_Both of them_ is just **los dos** or **ambos**. No **de ellos**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To say _both X and Y_, use **tanto X como Y**: **tanto Ana como Luis**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **ambos** travels alone; **los dos** always brings its article along."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
